Chaos Master wrote:
> I know that sometimes weapons break when you force a box/chest, but I'd like to 
> know one thing: What is the probability of a weapon breaking? Does it matter if 
> the weapon is blessed/(un)cursed and its enchantment?
> 

Here's the test from the code in 3.4.3:

rn2(1000-(int)uwep->spe) > (992-greatest_erosion(uwep)*10) &&
	       !uwep->cursed && !obj_resists(uwep, 0, 99)

If this test is true, the weapon breaks.  So enchantment reduces the
chance of the tool breaking to a small extent, erosion increases the
chance, and cursed weapons _won't_ break, but uncursed/blessed will
(makes sense, otherwise you'd have an easy way of getting rid
of a cursed, wielded weapon).


